answer.worked:
The quadrant has radius $x$.
$$\begin{align*}
P &= (x+1)+x+(2x+1)+\frac14(2\pi x)\\
P &= 4x+2+\frac{\pi x}{2}
\end{align*}$$

Add the rectangle and quadrant areas.
$$\begin{align*}
A &= x(x+1)+\frac14\pi x^2\\
A &= x^2+x+\frac{\pi x^2}{4}
\end{align*}$$

